msgstr "Pridat cleny z existujicich kontaktu"

#: post-type/module-base.php:562
msgctxt "Add members modal"
msgid ""
"In the 'Member List' field, type the name of an existing contact to add them "
"to this training."
msgstr ""
"Do pole 'Seznam clenu' zadejte jmeno existujiciho kontaktu, abyste jej "
"pridali do tohoto skoleni."

